tensen (official) Female, DoB: 1989-12-05 ( urn:oid:1.2.208.176.1.2#DK Central Person Registry (CPR)#0512894992 (use: official))</a></p><p><b>period</b>: 2026-09-28 09:05:00+0000 --&gt; (ongoing)</p><p><b>careTeam</b>: <a href=\"CareTeam-careteam-placeholder.html\">CareTeam Telemedicinsk KOL-team</a></p><p><b>addresses</b>: <a href=\"Condition-p05-eoc2-cond.html\">Condition Kronisk obstruktiv lungesygdom</a></p><blockquote><p><b>activity</b></p><p><b>reference</b>: <a href=\"ServiceRequest-p05-cp2-sr-head.html\">ServiceRequest Head activity</a></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>activity</b></p><p><b>reference</b>: <a href=\"ServiceRequest-p05-cp2-sr-intro.html\">ServiceRequest Instruktion</a></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>activity</b></p><p><b>reference</b>: <a href=\"ServiceRequest-p05-cp2-sr-sat-pulse-intro.html\">ServiceRequest Instruktion</a></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>activity</b></p><p><b>reference</b>: <a href=\"ServiceRequest-p05-cp2-sr-sat-pulse-prep.html\">ServiceRequest Instruktion</a></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>activity</b></p><p><b>reference</b>: <a href=\"ServiceRequest-p05-cp2-sr-sat-pulse.html\">ServiceRequest Same device group</a></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>activity</b></p><p><b>reference</b>: <a href=\"ServiceRequest-p05-cp2-sr-saturation.html\">ServiceRequest Hb(Fe; O2-bind.; aB)—Oxygen(O2); mætn. = ?</a></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>activity</b></p><p><b>reference</b>: <a href=\"ServiceRequest-p05-cp2-sr-pulse.html\">ServiceRequest Hjerte—Systole; frekv. = ? × 1/min</a></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>activity</b></p><p><b>reference</b>: <a href=\"ServiceRequest-p05-cp2-sr-questionnaire.html\">ServiceRequest Master Questionnaire</a></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>activity</b></p><p><b>reference</b>: <a href=\"ServiceRequest-p05-cp2-sr-closing.html\">ServiceRequest Instruktion</a></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>activity</b></p><p><b>reference</b>: <a href=\"ServiceRequest-p05-cp2-sr-extra-head.html\">ServiceRe